        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/546e819e29d770d822aaf042713a0f9e.avif?t=1761060686\" width=600 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/073ca7fcac62275e5a77264820bb1510.poster.avif?t=1761060686\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/073ca7fcac62275e5a77264820bb1510.webm?t=1761060686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/073ca7fcac62275e5a77264820bb1510.mp4?t=1761060686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Mare Show</strong> is a <strong>Horror/Arcade</strong> game set in a macabre circus world, full of mystery, danger...and fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Tom Lorich</strong>, a bankrupt compulsive gambler who entered this bizarre world for no apparent reason, and now has to get out at any cost, while experiencing his greatest traumas in the form of strange creatures, created by an enigmatic entity called <strong>Mare</strong>, with unknown motivations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/81fac63166a7377ff379bd46b9ae31d8.avif?t=1761060686\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras_big/81fac63166a7377ff379bd46b9ae31d8.avif?t=1761060686 width=800 height=251 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIFFERENT <strong>CREATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With different mechanics and visuals, you have to overcome them as best you can. From a pursuer Scarecrow to a macabre shadow, always watching you. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/d380285cf1ccf15c0a50ca87c3c80491.avif?t=1761060686\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras_big/d380285cf1ccf15c0a50ca87c3c80491.avif?t=1761060686 width=800 height=326 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE <strong>HALL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is your safe place. Here you can relax, analyze narrative pieces, change the visual of your flashlight and, of course, enter the dangerous levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/1e478776777fb45dc09955dd6549dc54.poster.avif?t=1761060686\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/1e478776777fb45dc09955dd6549dc54.webm?t=1761060686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/1e478776777fb45dc09955dd6549dc54.mp4?t=1761060686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RELICS</strong> TO FIND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect special relics throughout the levels to unlock new flashlight skins and narrative pieces to uncover the story behind this bizarre world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/60778513152ac46483feb7b9bc99ad79.poster.avif?t=1761060686\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/60778513152ac46483feb7b9bc99ad79.webm?t=1761060686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/60778513152ac46483feb7b9bc99ad79.mp4?t=1761060686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/41bf0c1d052b391a43e4b15432dc26b4.poster.avif?t=1761060686\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/41bf0c1d052b391a43e4b15432dc26b4.webm?t=1761060686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/405e7c25546bbdb2684034d54fa386e2.avif?t=1761060686\" width=600 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/546e819e29d770d822aaf042713a0f9e.avif?t=1761060686\" width=600 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/073ca7fcac62275e5a77264820bb1510.poster.avif?t=1761060686\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/073ca7fcac62275e5a77264820bb1510.webm?t=1761060686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/073ca7fcac62275e5a77264820bb1510.mp4?t=1761060686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Mare Show</strong> is a <strong>Horror/Arcade</strong> game set in a macabre circus world, full of mystery, danger...and fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Tom Lorich</strong>, a bankrupt compulsive gambler who entered this bizarre world for no apparent reason, and now has to get out at any cost, while experiencing his greatest traumas in the form of strange creatures, created by an enigmatic entity called <strong>Mare</strong>, with unknown motivations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/81fac63166a7377ff379bd46b9ae31d8.avif?t=1761060686\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras_big/81fac63166a7377ff379bd46b9ae31d8.avif?t=1761060686 width=800 height=251 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIFFERENT <strong>CREATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With different mechanics and visuals, you have to overcome them as best you can. From a pursuer Scarecrow to a macabre shadow, always watching you. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/d380285cf1ccf15c0a50ca87c3c80491.avif?t=1761060686\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras_big/d380285cf1ccf15c0a50ca87c3c80491.avif?t=1761060686 width=800 height=326 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE <strong>HALL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is your safe place. Here you can relax, analyze narrative pieces, change the visual of your flashlight and, of course, enter the dangerous levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/1e478776777fb45dc09955dd6549dc54.poster.avif?t=1761060686\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/1e478776777fb45dc09955dd6549dc54.webm?t=1761060686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/1e478776777fb45dc09955dd6549dc54.mp4?t=1761060686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RELICS</strong> TO FIND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect special relics throughout the levels to unlock new flashlight skins and narrative pieces to uncover the story behind this bizarre world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/60778513152ac46483feb7b9bc99ad79.poster.avif?t=1761060686\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/60778513152ac46483feb7b9bc99ad79.webm?t=1761060686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/60778513152ac46483feb7b9bc99ad79.mp4?t=1761060686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/41bf0c1d052b391a43e4b15432dc26b4.poster.avif?t=1761060686\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/41bf0c1d052b391a43e4b15432dc26b4.webm?t=1761060686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604520/extras/405e7c25546bbdb2684034d54fa386e2.avif?t=1761060686\" width=600 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
